{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17323260","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17323260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1732326001:1":{"text":"That's right! Those nobles who came back from the chapel have been singing the praises of King Rolan.","source_cn":"没错，那些失踪的老爷们回来后都在说，这次全靠罗兰大帝庇佑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FCBE2EB4D85024F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732326002:1":{"text":"But how could there be Hypofiends in the Hall of Ancients? Could the Queen have summoned them?","source_cn":"可是圣古堂怎么会有恶魔呢？难道这也是王后阴谋中的一环？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2F386EB155C452A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732326003:1":{"text":"What became of those Hypofiends in the end? Did King Rolan repel them, or did they simply flee?","source_cn":"那些恶魔呢？他们是被显灵的罗兰大帝消灭还是逃跑了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1ED3999E96E5A03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1732326004:1":{"text":"I hope they're not lurking around the city...","source_cn":"你说会不会有恶魔藏在附近的某个角落吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2773E20369BD5D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商贩博斯坦":{"text":"Trader Bosta","source":"商贩博斯坦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speake